    <h1 class="about-heading">About Wailea Art</h1>
    <p class="lede">Hawaii-inspired art, created with a professional eye.</p>

    <p>Wailea Art is a family-run art and design studio based in Maui, Hawaii, creating distinctive, Hawaii-inspired wall art for homes, businesses, galleries, boutiques, gift shops, vacation rentals, and hospitality spaces.</p>

    <p>Imagine your own gallery, gift shop, or boutique with walls filled with artwork that makes people stop, look, photograph, and ultimately take a piece of Hawaii home with them. That is what Wailea Art is designed to make possible.</p>

    <p>Whether you're furnishing a single feature wall or curating an entire retail collection, our artwork is created to make an impression — distinctive pieces that capture the color, energy, beauty, and character of the Hawaiian Islands.</p>

    <h2>A Family Creative Legacy</h2>
    <p>Long before Wailea Art, our family spent decades working professionally in the creative industries.</p>
    <p>Our experience spans bespoke ceramic jewelry design, professional photography, graphic design, advertising, and art direction. As an Art Director, our work included leading creative and advertising campaigns for major Hollywood studios, creating feature-film posters, billboards, and national advertising seen across the country.</p>
    <p>That same professional eye for composition, color, typography, and visual storytelling now goes into every piece we create — simply focused on a subject much closer to home: the light, color, culture, and spirit of Hawaii.</p>

    <h2>Original Art. Hawaii Inspired.</h2>
    <p>Every Wailea Art piece begins as an original creative work, combining digital media, Adobe Photoshop, Adobe Illustrator, and hand-drawn illustration.</p>
    <p>Our collections draw inspiration from the places, landscapes, colors, and character of the islands — from the resort coastline of Wailea and Kapalua, to the historic streets of Lahaina, the beaches and landscapes of Maui, and the vibrant energy of Honolulu and Oahu.</p>
    <p>The finished artwork is reproduced as a museum-quality print, created to bring the distinctive visual character of Hawaii into homes, businesses, and retail spaces.</p>

    <h2>Open Edition by Design</h2>
    <p>All Wailea Art artwork is <strong>open edition</strong> rather than limited edition.</p>
    <p>We believe you should be able to discover a piece you love today and still have the opportunity to purchase it tomorrow. We don't rely on artificial scarcity to sell our art.</p>
    <p>Our goal is simple: create beautiful artwork that people genuinely want to live with, display, and share.</p>

    <h2>Custom Sizes for Your Space</h2>
    <p>Every piece can be <strong>custom sized</strong> to suit your wall.</p>
    <p>If you have a particular space in mind, simply send us your wall dimensions and layout details through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>. We'll work with you to determine an appropriate print size for your space.</p>
    <p>Whether you're filling a small wall, creating a statement piece, or designing an entire art display, we're happy to help.</p>

    <h2>Wholesale Art for Retailers &amp; Galleries</h2>
    <p>Wailea Art offers wholesale pricing for retailers, galleries, and businesses throughout Hawaii, with opportunities for partnerships beyond the islands as well.</p>
    <p>Our prints are available individually or in bulk for:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Galleries</li>
      <li>Gift shops</li>
      <li>Boutiques</li>
      <li>Resort retailers</li>
      <li>Vacation rentals</li>
      <li>Hotels and hospitality businesses</li>
      <li>Interior designers</li>
      <li>Hawaii-themed retail stores</li>
      <li>Corporate and commercial spaces</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We currently serve businesses across Maui, Oahu, Kauai, and the Big Island, and we're also open to working with galleries, boutiques, gift retailers, and hospitality businesses throughout the mainland United States and internationally.</p>
    <p>For galleries and retailers outside Hawaii, Wailea Art offers an opportunity to bring the distinctive beauty and spirit of the Hawaiian Islands to customers far beyond Hawaii itself.</p>
    <p>We welcome conversations with established galleries, independent boutiques, specialty retailers, resorts, and other creative retail partners who are interested in carrying professionally designed Hawaii-inspired artwork.</p>
    <p>Whether you're located in Hawaii, California, New York, Florida, or on the other side of the world, we'd be happy to explore how Wailea Art might complement your collection or retail offering.</p>

    <h2>Carefully Packaged for Retail</h2>
    <p>Every individual retail order and packaged bulk order is carefully prepared with a protective plastic sleeve, support backing board, and white card envelope, helping ensure your artwork arrives clean, protected, and ready for framing or retail display.</p>

    <h2>Let's Create Something Beautiful</h2>
    <p>Have a question about a particular artwork, need a custom size, or interested in wholesale pricing for your Hawaii-based, mainland, or international gallery or business?</p>
    <p>We'd love to hear from you. Visit our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a> to get in touch with the Wailea Art team.</p>
